                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A campaign of deliberately using charm and flattery in order to achieve some goal, especially in a political or diplomatic field."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b666377-ed3a-4800-a845-7c7bb2730dd3",
                                                "sense_id": "3aeed1a4-5cbd-3345-ac29-93b39ebc6e47",
                                                "text": "Putin’s speech was a culmination of the Kremlin’s two-day charm offensive with China, aimed at cementing ties between the two countries amid Russia’s growing isolation from the west."
